            <textarea id="w-front" rows="2" placeholder="${_d(a0_0x5697c8(0x3fae,'\x33\x48\x44\x43')+a0_0x5697c8(0x14c7,'\x35\x30\x5e\x62'))}://… / trojan://… / ${_d('\x63\x33\x4d\x36')}//… / ${_d(a0_0x5697c8(0x3203,'\x66\x6e\x29\x4a')+a0_0x5697c8(0x1d7d,'\x39\x25\x33\x29'))}://…（WARP 节点经它拨号，可绕过运营商对 UDP 的封锁）"></textarea>
